    \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 4,\n      \"maxItems\": 7,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\"attraction\", \"meal\", \"accommodation\", \"transport\"]\n          },\n          \"title\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"location\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n            }\n          },\n          \"timing\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"startTime\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"endTime\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"durationMin\": { \"type\": \"integer\" }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"type\", \"timing\"]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"dayNumber\", \"date\", \"location\", \"nodes\"]\n}\n\n\nUser request: Create skeleton structure for:\nDay 4 of 5\nDate: 2025-11-30\nDestination: Switzerland, Switzerland\n\n=== CITY CONTEXT FOR THIS DAY ===\nCity: Interlaken\nCity Type: nature (gateway/nature/cultural/urban)\nDay 3 of 3 in this city\nCity Highlights: Excursion to Jungfraujoch 'Top of Europe', Experience paragliding over Interlaken, Explore Lauterbrunnen Valley and its waterfalls (Trummelbach Falls), Take a scenic boat trip on Lake Thun or Lake Brienz, Hike or take a cogwheel train to Schynige Platte for panoramic views\n\n=== PREVIOUS DAYS CONTEXT ===\nPrevious days in this trip:\nDay 1 (Zurich): Morning Cultural Exploration of Zurich Old Town & Lindenhof Hill, Luxury Shopping Experience on Bahnhofstrasse, Gourmet Swiss Chocolate Tasting Experience\nDay 2 (Interlaken, Switzerland): Scenic Luxury Boat Cruise on Lake Thun\nDay 3 (Interlaken, Switzerland): Morning Premium Excursion to Jungfraujoch 'Top of Europe', Evening Scenic Stroll and Photography at Höhematte Park\n\nIMPORTANT: Avoid repeating similar activities from previous days.\n\nBudget preference: luxury\nIMPORTANT: Interpret budget tier relative to Switzerland, Switzerland:\n- 'luxury' means premium experiences appropriate for this destination\n- High-end accommodations, fine dining, private transport\n- Exclusive activities, VIP experiences, premium services\nAll cost estimates should be PER PERSON in local currency.\nAdjust recommendations based on local cost of living and tourism standards.\n\nInterests: adventure, shopping, photography, culture, food\n\n=== NODE COUNT REQUIREMENTS ===\nMINIMUM nodes required: 4 (CRITICAL - schema will reject if less)\nExpected nodes for this day: 3\nReason: Nature destination (safaris/treks take 4-8 hours)\n\nCRITICAL: You MUST generate at least 4 nodes.\nIf you generate fewer nodes, the response will be REJECTED.\n\nGenerate time slots with node type placeholders.\nUse descriptive titles like 'Morning Cultural Exploration', 'Lunch at Local Restaurant', etc.\nFocus on timing and logical flow, not specific places.\nConsider the party size when planning activities and meal venues.\nCRITICAL: Use node IDs in format 'day4_node1', 'day4_node2', etc.\n\n\nRespond with ONLY the JSON, no additional text or formatting:"
    }]
  }],
